        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-112601-113818"><seg source="#source-112601-112613">しかし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112613-112628"><rb>俺</rb><rt>おれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112628-112631">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112631-112655"><rb>有害</rb><rt>ゆうがい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112655-112667">なことに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112667-112682"><rb>務</rb><rt>つと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112682-112694">めてると</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112694-112706"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112706-112721">うものだ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112721-112742"><rb>自分</rb><rt>じぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112742-112745">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112745-112763"><rb>欺</rb><rt>あざむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112763-112775">いている</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112775-112799"><rb>人間</rb><rt>にんげん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112799-112805">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112805-112835"><rb>給料</rb><rt>きゅうりょう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112835-112838">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112838-112856"><rb>貪</rb><rt>むさぼ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112856-112871">っている、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112871-112904"><rb>不正直</rb><rt>ふしょうじき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112904-112922">だ、けれども</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112922-112937"><rb>俺</rb><rt>おれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112937-112943">その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112943-112958"><rb>者</rb><rt>もの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112958-112961">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112961-112976"><rb>至</rb><rt>いた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112976-112982">って</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right"