        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-122410-122568"><seg source="#source-122410-122443">イワン、デミトリチは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-122443-122458"><rb>高</rb><rt>たか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-122458-122461">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-122461-122521"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-U-544C-47-10" source="#source-122461-122509">呌</g></rb><rt>さけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-122521-122530">んで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-122530-122545"><rb>笑</rb><rt>わら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-122545-122548">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-122548-122560"><rb>出</rb><rt>だ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-122560-122568">す。</seg></p>
