        <p source="#source-157146-157745">『そうじゃ<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-157161-157173"><rb>無</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-157173-157185">いです。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-157185-157206"><rb>貴方</rb><rt>あなた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-157206-157221">もいよいよ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-157221-157236"><rb>深</rb><rt>ふか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-157236-157239">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-157239-157263"><rb>考慮</rb><rt>かんがえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-157263-157275">るように</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-157275-157287"><rb>成</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-157287-157305">ったならば、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-157305-157329"><rb>我々</rb><rt>われわれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-157329-157332">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-157332-157350"><rb>心</rb><rt>こころ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-157350-157353">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-157353-157371"><rb>動</rb><rt>うごか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-157371-157374">す</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-157374-157392"><rb>所</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-157392-157398">の、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-157398-157413"><rb>総</rb><rt>すべ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-157413-157419">ての</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-157419-157443"><rb>身外</rb><rt>しんがい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-157443-157446">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-157446-157467"><rb>些細</rb><rt>ささい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-157467-157482">なることは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-157482-157494"><rb>苦</rb><rt>く</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-157494-157515">にもならぬとお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-157515-157530"><rb>解</rb><rt>わか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-157530-157542">りに