        <p source="#source-197036-197446">『しかし<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-197048-197066"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-197066-197069">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-197069-197084"><rb>少</rb><rt>すこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-197084-197090">しも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-197090-197111"><rb>身体</rb><rt>からだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-197111-197114">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-197114-197138"><rb>異状</rb><rt>いじょう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-197138-197141">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-197141-197153"><rb>無</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-197153-197165">いです、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-197165-197189"><rb>壮健</rb><rt>そうけん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-197189-197198">です。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-197198-197219"><rb>無暗</rb><rt>むやみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-197219-197222">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-197222-197240"><rb>出掛</rb><rt>でか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-197240-197255">けることは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-197255-197273"><rb>出来</rb><rt>でき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-197273-197294">ません、どうぞ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-197294-197312"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-197312-197315">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-197315-197342"><rb>友情</rb><rt>ゆうじょう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-197342-197345">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-197345-197357"><rb>他</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-197357-197369">のことで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-197369-197384"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-197384-197390">とか</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-197390-197408"><rb>証</rb><rt>しょう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-197408-197417">させて</s