        <p source="#source-198357-198545">『しかし<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-198369-198390"><rb>貴方</rb><rt>あなた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-198390-198396">は一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-198396-198414"><rb>体</rb><rt>たい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-198414-198426">どこへお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-198426-198444"><rb>出掛</rb><rt>でか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-198444-198462">けになろうと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-198462-198474"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby>うのです？』<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-198492-198519"><rb>院長</rb><rt>いんちょう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-198519-198522">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-198522-198534"><rb>問</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-198534-198545">うた。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-198545-198951">『モスクワへも、ペテルブルグへも、ワルシャワへも……ワルシャワは<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-198641-198656"><rb>実</rb><rt>じつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-198656-198665">によい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-198665-198683"><rb>所</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-198683-198692">です、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-198692-198710"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-198710-198713">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-198713-198737"><rb>幸福</rb><rt>こうふく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-198737-198743">の五</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-198743-198770"><rb>年間</rb><rt>ねんかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-198770-198773">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-198773-198794"><rb>彼処</rb><rt>あすこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-198794-198797">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-198797-198812"><rb>送</rb><rt>おく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-198812-198848">ったのでした、それはいい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-198848-198863"><rb>町</rb><rt>まち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-198863-198872">です、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-198872-198890"><rb>是非</rb><rt>ぜひ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-198890-198902"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-198902-198926">きましょう、ねえ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-198926-198941"><rb>君</rb><rt>きみ</rt></ruby>。』</p>
