        <p source="#source-202831-203412"><seg source="#source-202831-202834">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202834-202858"><rb>私等</rb><rt>わたしら</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202858-202879"><rb>二人</rb><rt>ふたり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-202879-202882">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202882-202897"><rb>中</rb><rt>うち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-202897-202900">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202900-202915"><rb>何</rb><rt>いず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-202915-202921">れが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202921-202954"><rb>瘋癲者</rb><rt>ふうてんしゃ</rt></ruby>だろうか。』と、ドクトルは<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-202993-203017"><rb>腹立</rb><rt>はらだた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-203017-203032">しくなって</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-203032-203047"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby>うた。『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-203059-203074"><rb>少</rb><rt>すこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-203074-203080">しも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-203080-203110"><rb>乗客</rb><rt>じょうきゃく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-203110-203113">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-203113-203131"><rb>煩</rb><rt>わずら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-203131-203149">わさんように</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-203149-203164"><rb>務</rb><rt>つと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-203164-203176">めている</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-203176-203191"><rb>俺</rb><rt>おれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-203191-203221">か、それともこんなに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-203221-203242"><rb>一人</rb><rt>ひとり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-203242-203245">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-203245-203272"><rb>大騒</rb><rt>おおさわぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-203272-203290">をしていた、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2032