        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-207356-207859"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-207359-207386"><rb>中食</rb><rt>ちゅうじき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-207386-207401">はテストフ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-207401-207416"><rb>亭</rb><rt>てい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-207416-207419">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-207419-207431"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-207431-207434">う</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-207434-207467"><rb>料理店</rb><rt>りょうりてん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-207467-207470">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-207470-207485"><rb>入</rb><rt>はい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-207485-207554">ったが、ここでもミハイル、アウエリヤヌイチは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-207554-207578"><rb>頬鬚</rb><rt>ほおひげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-207578-207581">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-207581-207593"><rb>撫</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-207593-207629">でながら、ややしばらく、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-207629-207653"><rb>品書</rb><rt>しながき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-207653-207656">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-207656-207677"><rb>拈転</rb><rt>ひねく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-207677-207686">って、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-207686-207716"><rb>料理店</rb><rt>りょうりや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-207716-207719">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-207719-207731"><rb>我</rb><rt>わ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-207731-207734">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-207734-207746"><rb>家</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-207746-207758">のように</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-207758-207779"><rb>挙動</rb><rt>ふるま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-207779-207782">う</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-207782-207824"><rb>愛食家風</rb><rt>あいしょくかふう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-207824-207827">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-207827-207851"><rb>調子</rb><rt>ちょうし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-207851-207859">で。</seg></p>
