        <p source="#source-245593-246021"><seg source="#source-245593-245596">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-245596-245611"><rb>肺</rb><rt>はい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-245611-245614">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-245614-245629"><rb>方</rb><rt>ほう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-245629-245635">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-245635-245647"><rb>来</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-245647-245650">た</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-245650-245677"><rb>病人</rb><rt>びょうにん</rt></ruby>なのですがな。』とハバトフは<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-245719-245740"><rb>小声</rb><rt>こごえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-245740-245743">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-245743-245755"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby>うた。『や、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-245773-245791"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-245791-245794">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-245794-245827"><rb>聴診器</rb><rt>ちょうしんき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-245827-245830">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-245830-245845"><rb>忘</rb><rt>わす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-245845-245851">れて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-245851-245863"><rb>来</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-245863-245869">た、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-245869-245881"><rb>直</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-245881-245884">ぐ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-245884-245896"><rb>取</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-245896-245902">って</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-245902-245914"><rb>来</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-245914-245941">ますから、ちょっと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-245941-245962"><rb>貴方</rb><rt>あなた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-245962-245977">はここでお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" sou